l the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $B-{B}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -5 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-126477/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-126477"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-126484/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "830df808-4172-5ba8-bcb0-16b19a9b2f86" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-126484/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "6e8e0400-3987-5e63-a9a3-428ebf1f3afe" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-126484/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "6bffcc49-e236-56fb-b07d-879c818e4aa8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-126484/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "74cd98dd-6c56-50dd-a108-1fc2a98a699f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-126484/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #